ge": "engenn7le18ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>We at Kitchen Innovations will take your cooking troubles away. If you engage us, you are tapping into a service that will make your life easier!  Our friendly employees will be here to help you if you are ready. You're going to find them polite, courteous and helpful. Starting tomorrow, we're offering a discount, so don't hesitate.</p>", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn7le18ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<p>We'll worry about rustling up your dinner. Enjoy your day while we're shopping for your food, chopping up your vegetables, mixing up your ingredients and doing your baking. Your dinner party is going to run smoothly.</p><p>No more overcooked vegetables or burnt meat! Just relax, dig in, eat up and drink up with your guests.</p><p>At Kitchen Innovations we have your meal in hand.</p>", "id": 3, "time": "37500", "image": "engenn7le18ob05re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}